(ns home-care.facts
  "Disclosed facts the Home Care Governor enforces — each one quoted verbatim
  from a fetched primary source, never recalled.

  Source: 厚生労働省「職場における腰痛予防対策指針」(2013-06-18 改訂, 別添).
  The guideline's 別紙 Ⅳ covers 訪問介護・看護 by name, so it applies to an
  independent home-based personal care worker (ISCO-08 5322), not only to
  facilities.

  Provenance (2026-09-25): GET of `guideline-url` returned 200,
  application/pdf, 1,034,303 bytes, sha256
  806baf072af5cc742ddc203e9ea31cf327961d6f6264e726cc99f11c0e45d6e5; a sibling
  attachment name (…mu2_2.pdf) returned 404, so the 200 is evidence about
  THIS document. Each `:source-quote` was matched as an exact substring of
  `pdftotext -layout` output with whitespace removed.

  What is NOT here: the guideline tells the employer to *consider* a sliding
  board (sitting-capable client) or standing machine (standing-capable
  client) — that is advice, so the governor only recommends it. The one
  prohibition (原則として…行わせないこと) is the only hard rule derived.")

(def guideline-url
  "https://www.mhlw.go.jp/stf/houdou/2r98520000034et4-att/2r98520000034pjn_1.pdf")

(def scope
  {:source-url guideline-url
   :section "別紙 Ⅳ 福祉・医療分野等における介護・看護作業"
   :source-quote "高齢者介護施設・障害児者施設・保育所等の社会福祉施設、医療機関、訪問介護・看護、特別支援学校での教育等で介護・看護作業等を行う場合には"})

(def no-manual-lift-of-full-assist
  "The hard rule: a client who needs full assistance is not lifted by human
  strength; a lift is used."
  {:source-url guideline-url
   :section "別紙 Ⅳ 3 (3) イ 抱上げ"
   :source-quote "移乗介助、入浴介助及び排泄介助における対象者の抱上げは、労働者の腰部に著しく負担がかかることから、全介助の必要な対象者には、リフト等を積極的に使用することとし、原則として人力による人の抱上げは行わせないこと。"
   :mobility :full-assist
   :forbidden-method :manual})

(def aid-by-mobility
  "Advisory: which aid the guideline names for a client's retained function."
  {:source-url guideline-url
   :section "別紙 Ⅳ 3 (3) イ 抱上げ"
   :source-quote "対象者が座位保持できる場合にはスライディングボード等の使用、立位保持できる場合にはスタンディングマシーン等の使用を含めて検討し、対象者に適した方法で移乗介助を行わせること。"
   :aid {:full-assist :lift
         :sitting     :sliding-board
         :standing    :standing-machine}})
